{"type":"FeatureCollection","locode":"VNSGN","quays":["VNCLI"],"attribution":"© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright","position_outside":"UN/LOCODE places Ho Chi Minh City at 10.7667, 106.6667, in the city's western districts, about 5 km west of the Khanh Hoi wharves and well inland of every quay. A ship cannot be there.","position_on_water":false,"selection_digest":"ac109beb87829410516c78782ba59794fc5151d529c2f7963c077a73ba0a38bd","features":[
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"port_limits","cargo":[],"osm":["way/410427637","way/941591564","way/533426624","way/1419594543","way/1419557203","way/1419558279","way/1419558280","way/220688059","way/226937992","relation/6946894"],"source":"Derived: the convex hull of this port's terminals from OpenStreetMap, grown by 300 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it (the sea within its coastline, rivers, docks and basins), with the terminals kept whole","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-23","clip":"water","note":"OpenStreetMap maps no port limits for Ho Chi Minh City. These are the hull of the terminals below, grown by 300 m and cut to the rivers OpenStreetMap maps inside it, with the terminals kept whole: the Saigon river from Khanh Hoi round Thu Thiem to its meeting with the Dong Nai, the Dong Nai past Cat Lai, and the creeks that open off them. Thu Thiem, Cat Lai town and the city are land and left out. A scan of OpenStreetMap finds no homes, schools, hospitals or places of worship inside. Seven residential areas on the banks reach in where they are drawn over the river, by about 2 ha in all, most of it a strip of Khu đô thị Sala in Thu Thiem, none of it more than 40 m inside, and an island's shore by 320 m²; the only named place is a Khu phố 26 neighbourhood label on the river bank.","inside":{"houses":0,"residential_m2":20788,"residential":[{"osm":"way/1424917259","name":"Khu đô thị Sala","m2":17810},{"osm":"way/1473315148","name":"Thủ Thiêm Green House","m2":1239},{"osm":"way/405098018","name":"Khu dân cư Nam Long","m2":1125}],"amenities":0,"places":[{"name":"Khu phố 26","place":"neighbourhood","osm":"node/13347020134"}]}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[106.741913,10.7414],[106.74351,10.739807],[106.742106,10.738403],[106.743486,10.736933],[106.743376,10.736695],[106.743731,10.736785],[106.743797,10.736712],[106.742806,10.735813],[106.741843,10.735526],[106.740953,10.735592],[106.740753,10.735659],[106.740444,10.736152